{"final":{"answer":"The net change in Entergy Mississippi, Inc.'s net revenue from 2002 to 2003 was an increase of $46.4 million.","value":46.4,"unit":"USD_million","result_id":"tool:1","sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t4c1n0"],"explanation":"2003 net revenue ($426.6 million) minus 2002 net revenue ($380.2 million) = $46.4 million. This is consistent with the components in the table: base rates +48.3 and other -1.9, giving a net change of 46.4."}}